        "x1": 369,
        "tag": "title",
        "text": "Reminiscences and regrets"
      },
      {
        "y": 70.5,
        "x0": 75.1,
        "x1": 278.7,
        "tag": "title",
        "text": "A Looking back: sharing memories"
      },
      {
        "y": 88.4,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 299.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "A: It’s great to see you again. Gosh, it’s ten years"
      },
      {
        "y": 100.4,
        "x0": 110.6,
        "x1": 310.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "since we were at school together! Any idea what"
      },
      {
        "y": 112.4,
        "x0": 110.6,
        "x1": 230.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "the school is like these days?"
      },
      {
        "y": 124,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 313.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "B: No, I’ve been a bit out of touch1 with things ever"
      },
      {
        "y": 136.4,
        "x0": 110.6,
        "x1": 250.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "since I moved away from London."
      },
      {
        "y": 148,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 306,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "A: I wonder what became of2 that maths teacher."
      },
      {
        "y": 160,
        "x0": 110.6,
        "x1": 306.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "I think his name, if I recall3, was Mr Sanderson."
      },
      {
        "y": 172,
        "x0": 110.6,
        "x1": 302.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "When I think back4, I realise now how difficult"
      },
      {
        "y": 184.4,
        "x0": 110.6,
        "x1": 306.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "things must have been for him, having to teach"
      },
      {
        "y": 196,
        "x0": 110.6,
        "x1": 318.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "the likes of us! And do you ever hear anything of5"
      },
      {
        "y": 208.4,
        "x0": 110.6,
        "x1": 142,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "James?"
      },
      {
        "y": 220.4,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 223.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "B: No, I haven’t heard a thing."
      },
      {
        "y": 232.4,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 313.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "A: And I often wonder what Sanjay ended up doing."
      },
      {
        "y": 244,
        "x0": 110.6,
        "x1": 453.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "I’ve lost touch with him too. Thinking back, we had some great times, didn’t we?"
      },
      {
        "y": 256,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 510,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "B: Yeah. Seeing your phone there reminds me of how we used to text under our desks, right under"
      },
      {
        "y": 268.4,
        "x0": 110.6,
        "x1": 189.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "the teacher’s nose."
      },
      {
        "y": 280,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 512.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "A: Yeah, that takes me back to6 the day my phone rang when a school inspector was observing our"
      },
      {
        "y": 292.4,
        "x0": 110.6,
        "x1": 239.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "class and I got into big trouble."
      },
      {
        "y": 304,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 515.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "B: Yes, I have a vague memory7 of that. Actually, it’s all coming back to me now8. They confiscated"
      },
      {
        "y": 316.4,
        "x0": 110.6,
        "x1": 322.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "your phone and you stormed out of the classroom!"
      },
      {
        "y": 328,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 513.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "A: Yeah. But I must say that what stands out in my mind9 is the amazing freedom we used to have."
      },
      {
        "y": 340,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 391.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "B: Me too. When I look back, I realise how much things have changed."
      },
      {
        "y": 352,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 519.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "A: Yes, I often find myself reminiscing about10 my teenage years and wonder if our children will have"
      },
      {
        "y": 364.4,
        "x0": 110.6,
        "x1": 306.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "the same happy memories when they grow up."
      },
      {
        "y": 376,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 521.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "B: Yes, we all tend to look at the past through rose-tinted spectacles11, don’t we? But I guess a bit of"
      },
      {
        "y": 388,
        "x0": 110.6,
        "x1": 258.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "nostalgia12 does nobody any harm!"
      },
      {
        "y": 405,
        "x0": 101,
        "x1": 505.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 not knowing what has happened recently 10 thinking about pleasant things that happened in"
      },
      {
        "y": 417,
        "x0": 101,
        "x1": 354,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "2 where he is and what happened to him the past"
      },
      {
        "y": 430,
