      },
      {
        "y": 547,
        "x0": 74.7,
        "x1": 195.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "B Expressing regret"
      },
      {
        "y": 556,
        "x0": 364.7,
        "x1": 509.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Don’t confuse remind and remember:"
      },
      {
        "y": 564.5,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 345.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "I regret not spending more time with my aunt when she was ill."
      },
      {
        "y": 568.2,
        "x0": 364.7,
        "x1": 474.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Seeing the class photo again"
      },
      {
        "y": 576.5,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 316.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "He showed no sign of remorse for what he had done."
      },
      {
        "y": 579.6,
        "x0": 364.7,
        "x1": 476.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "reminded me of my unhappy"
      },
      {
        "y": 588.5,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 340.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "She said she felt great shame for what had happened and"
      },
      {
        "y": 592,
        "x0": 364.7,
        "x1": 502,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "schooldays (NOT remembered me)."
      },
      {
        "y": 601,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 306.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "apologised to us all. [embarrassment and guilt about"
      },
      {
        "y": 613.9,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 216,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "something bad that happened]"
      },
      {
        "y": 624.5,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 494.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "I felt great pangs of guilt and remorse thinking of all the bad things that had happened and my"
      },
      {
        "y": 636.5,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 506.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "part in them. [sudden sharp feelings, especially of painful emotion; collocates frequently with guilt, regret,"
      },
      {
        "y": 648.5,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 185.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "conscience, remorse]"
      },
      {
        "y": 661,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 325.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Some formal, rather literary ways of expressing regret:"
      },
      {
        "y": 672.5,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 519.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "I rue the day we ever met. [I regret very much that we ever met; collocates strongly with ‘the day’ and ‘the fact that’]"
