      {
        "y": 87.8,
        "x0": 121.2,
        "x1": 528.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 back, I can’t believe how I survived the first day in my old job. It was horrendous."
      },
      {
        "y": 99.8,
        "x0": 121.2,
        "x1": 536.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "2 What in my mind when I think of my schooldays was our class trip to"
      },
      {
        "y": 111.8,
        "x0": 133.2,
        "x1": 179.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Edinburgh."
      },
      {
        "y": 123.8,
        "x0": 121.2,
        "x1": 526.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "3 What of that friend of yours who wanted to be a pilot? Did he ever get to be one?"
      },
      {
        "y": 135.8,
        "x0": 121.2,
        "x1": 502.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "4 Do you ever hear your old college friend Martine these days?"
      },
      {
        "y": 147.8,
        "x0": 121.2,
        "x1": 482.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "5 When I , we had quite a hard life; my parents were poor."
      },
      {
        "y": 159.8,
        "x0": 121.2,
        "x1": 520.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "6 When I get together with my old schoolmates, we often about the fun times we"
      },
      {
        "y": 171.8,
        "x0": 133.2,
        "x1": 151.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "had."
      },
      {
        "y": 183.8,
        "x0": 121.2,
        "x1": 529.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "7 I’m a bit of with what’s happening with our old hockey team since I"
      },
      {
        "y": 195.8,
        "x0": 133.2,
        "x1": 429.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "stopped playing, but someone said they’re doing quite well these days."
      },
      {
        "y": 207.8,
        "x0": 121.2,
        "x1": 520.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "8 I got a sudden feeling of as we drove past our old house. We’d had some happy"
      },
      {
        "y": 219.8,
        "x0": 133.2,
        "x1": 183.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "times there."
      },
      {
        "y": 231.8,
        "x0": 121.2,
        "x1": 533.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "9 When I saw the photo, it all back to me just what a wonderful holiday we had had."
      },
      {
        "y": 243.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 534,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "10 You’re always looking at the past through rose- spectacles. It wasn’t all wonderful,"
      },
      {
        "y": 255.8,
        "x0": 133.2,
        "x1": 176,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "you know."
      },
      {
        "y": 267.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 534,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "11 I have only a very memory of my early childhood in Canada. It was all so long ago!"
      },
      {
        "y": 279.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 532.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "12 What happened to your sister? If I , she wanted to study chemistry, didn’t she? Did"
      },
      {
        "y": 291.8,
        "x0": 133.2,
        "x1": 204.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "she ever do that?"
      },
      {
        "y": 307.9,
        "x0": 78.5,
        "x1": 102,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "77.2"
      },
      {
