        "x1": 341.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 I felt some pangs a my lost youth."
      },
      {
        "y": 339.2,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 418.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "2 I rue the day b because I’d done nothing wrong."
