        "tag": "main",
        "text": "77.3"
      },
      {
        "y": 405.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 440,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Write these sentences in more formal language. Use the word in brackets."
      },
      {
        "y": 422.5,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 369.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 I’m sorry that I didn’t buy her a birthday present. (regret)"
      },
      {
        "y": 434.5,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 457.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "2 They didn’t seem the least bit concerned about what they had done. (remorse)"
      },
      {
        "y": 446.5,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 397.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "3 I now greatly regret the fact that I discontinued my studies. (rue)"
      },
      {
        "y": 458.5,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 349.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "4 I wish our relationship hadn’t broken down. (lament)"
      },
      {
        "y": 470.5,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 424.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "5 The whole village felt sad about the loss of the beautiful trees. (mourn)"
      },
